## Secrets

- Loaded only from {{settings_source}}; never in code, commits, fixtures, URLs or client bundles.
- Stored secrets are encrypted with {{encryption_helper}}.
- Git-ignored env files: {{ignored_env_files}}.
- A secret that leaked (commit, log, screenshot) is rotated, not just deleted.

## Sensitive data

What counts as sensitive here: {{sensitive_data}} <!-- GEN: e.g. credentials, tokens, emails, personal names, customer documents -->

- Logs: context fields ({{log_context}}) yes; tokens, passwords, personal data no.
- User-facing errors: generic message + request id; details only in server logs.

## Cryptography

Use {{crypto_libraries}}; never homemade crypto; secure random for tokens.

